12. Protocol Contract (v1.2) & Frozen Shared Transports
Topic Structure
* State: ddoodle/{home_id}/{device_id}/state (Retained, QoS 1)
* Command: ddoodle/{home_id}/{device_id}/cmd (QoS 1)
* Telemetry: ddoodle/{home_id}/{device_id}/telemetry (QoS 0/1)
* Critical Alert: ddoodle/{home_id}/{device_id}/alert (QoS 1)
* Online/Offline LWT: ddoodle/{home_id}/{device_id}/status ("online" / "offline", Retained)
* Config & Guardrails: ddoodle/{home_id}/{device_id}/config (QoS 1, Retained)
* Local Schedules & Rules: ddoodle/{home_id}/{device_id}/rules (QoS 1, Retained)
* OTA Update: ddoodle/{home_id}/{device_id}/ota (QoS 1)
* Device Info (G1): ddoodle/{home_id}/{device_id}/info (Retained, QoS 1)
