Frozen Shared Transports Reference
* BLE GATT DD_OODLE_CTRL UUID Table (Canonical Lowercase):
   * Base UUID: dd00xxxx-0d1e-4f5a-8b6c-3e9f2a7c1b40
   * Service: dd000001-0d1e-4f5a-8b6c-3e9f2a7c1b40
   * AUTH Challenge/Response (dd000002): Write nonce challenge, read HMAC-SHA256(local_key, nonce).
   * CMD (dd000003), STATE (dd000004), TELEMETRY (dd000005), ALERT (dd000006), CONFIG (dd000007), RULES (dd000008), INFO (dd000009).
* LAN HTTP/WS API Table (Port 80):
   * mDNS service: _ddoodle._tcp at ddoodle-{device_id}.local
   * Endpoints: GET /api/v1/info, GET /api/v1/state, POST /api/v1/cmd, GET /api/v1/config, POST /api/v1/config, WS /api/v1/ws
   * Authentication: DD-HMAC header (HMAC-SHA256 signature with +-60s timestamp window) OR G7 local_pin session cookie.
* SoftAP Provisioning Flow:
   * SSID: DDoodle-Setup-XXXX (IP: 192.168.4.1)
   * POST /api/v1/prov payload: { ssid, pass, home_id, claim_token, local_key, operation_mode? }
* OTA Firmware Security:
   * Headers: X-DD-SHA256, X-DD-FW. Verification: ESP32 Secure Boot v2 signature validation + 60s rollback watchdog baseline.
