* Sprint 1 (Foundation & Simulator): Next.js App Router PWA boilerplate, Firebase Auth (Phone/Email), Firestore + RTDB security rules, MQTT-to-Firebase Cloud Run bridge, Entitlement Resolver (Core/Plus/Drive/Shield/All-In), Capability UI Engine, and a dev-mode Virtual Device Simulator to test all Phase 1 hardware before PCBs arrive.
* Sprint 2 (Phase 1 MVP Experience): Full interactive dashboards for PWR-01, PWR-02, PWR-03, WAT-01, VEH-01 (MapLibre live tracker + 20s Crash SOS modal), HUB-01 (4-Tier Connectivity Pill + Mode/BLE Fallback), Lightweight Three.js 3D Home View (1BHK–3BHK templates + Eco 2D fallback), and Recipes + Pro Logic automation UI.
* Sprint 3 (Operations, Voice & Scale): /admin Installer Portal (QR provisioning, ₹999 DFY 3D Twin Builder, OTA manager, 4G SIM & AMC tracker), Phase 1.5 Voice C2C endpoints (Google Home / Alexa / Siri Shortcuts), and remaining Phase 2/3 capability widgets.